#: includes/Templates.php:816
msgid "Thermal Printer Receipt"
msgstr "Thermische kassabon"

#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:817
msgid ""
"Narrow monospace layout designed for 80mm/58mm thermal receipt printers. Includes tax ID, itemised tax breakdown, and tendered/change lines."
msgstr ""
"Nauwe monospacelayout ontworpen voor 80mm/58mm thermische printers. Bevat belasting-ID, per-rijk-nog-transactie-ontleding en tandel/verander lijnen."

#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:825
msgid ""
"Shows items without prices. Displays the customer note as a gift message. Useful for gift wrapping counters."
msgstr ""
"Toont items zonder prijzen. Toont de klantnotitie als bijzegel-bericht. Handig voor cadeauverpakking-counters."

#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:832
msgid "Simple Receipt (Logicless)"
msgstr "Eenvoudige kassabon (logicloos)"

#. translators: Receipt template post type or template option label.
#: includes/Templates.php:833
msgid ""
"Full receipt using the logicless template engine with section blocks for line items, payments, and conditionals. No PHP required — just HTML and CSS."
msgstr ""
"Volledige kassabon met logicloze sjabloonmotor, met sectieblokken voor itemlijnen, betalingen en conditionals. Geen PHP vereist — alleen HTML en CSS."

